Game Boy Pokémon companion (the kiwami fork of BananaOS's banana-ui)

The sources in this folder read Pokémon Red, Blue, Yellow, Gold, Silver and Crystal while they play, for the pages on
the game panel. They are written with PokeDaisy's Kotlin readers as their model, so they are a work based on
PokeDaisy, under its licence: the GNU General Public License version 3 (LICENSE) with the additional term below.
The banana-ui the fork builds links them, so it is a GPL-3.0 work as a whole (kiwami/GB-POKEMON.md).

